                    "A TENUOUS HOLD\n\nCole Seeder is known only for his iron control. On the football field, he operates with cutting precision, guided by a cold heart and clear eyes. Off the field, he�s sinking. A dark secret and expanding void fray his famed control. His only hope for survival: a name scribbled on a flimsy notecard. The woman who took more than just his name.\n\nA DESPERATE PROPOSAL\n\nJo will never forget that day in City Hall, holding hands with her devilishly handsome hero. With his favor, he revived her, and disappeared. But now, after all these years, Cole�s returned. Like a knight, he charges into her life, intent on rescuing her again. Jo thought she was through with being saved, but how can she resist him? As the heat between husband and wife rages, discoveries and admissions burn too hot. Could it be that the man she married is the one who truly needs salvation?"
